WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:01.720
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:07.809
There are some wild conspiracy theories out
there, lets delve into some of the most recently

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:16.180
concocted theories.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:21.780
One of the most prolific conspiracies of recent
years is the disappearance of Malaysia Airlines

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:28.430
Boeing 777 flight MH370 on the 8th March 2014.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.810
Theories range from alien abduction to a terrorist
hijacking.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:37.210
But one of the most disturbing conspiracies
surrounding the plane's disappearance arose,

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:43.990
when it was discovered that an identical plane
to Malaysian Airlines flight MH370 was found

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:49.780
in storage at Tel Aviv's Ben Gurion Airport
in Israel.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:56.040
The twin plane has been in storage at Tel
Aviv airport since November, 2013.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:01.090
The only difference between this plane and
the one that disappeared over the Indian ocean

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:03.150
is the serial number.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:08.540
So why do Israel have this identical plane
in storage and what are they planning to do

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.249
with it?

00:01:10.249 --> 00:01:15.600
Conspiracy theorists believe Israel are planning
a false flag terror attack on the United States

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:22.619
similar to 9/11, where the plane will be filled
with explosives and flown into Manhattan.

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:29.030
There are also theories that Iran are involved
in this planned attack against the US.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:34.209
Conspiracy theorists believe the real Malaysian
Airlines flight was hijacked and flown to

00:01:34.209 --> 00:01:40.920
Iran where it was hidden from public view
in preparation for a terror attack.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:46.920
This theory is backed up by the fact that
two Iranian men boarded the missing MH370

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.209
flight using stolen passports.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:52.490
Could they have hijacked the plane?

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:59.399
But this isn't the only popular theory, others
include involvement from the Illuminati, North

00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:02.009
Korea and even Edward Snowden.

00:02:02.009 --> 00:02:08.509
It could be pure coincidence but a Reddit
user pointed out the missing Malaysian plane

00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:15.200
was the 404th Boeing 777 to have ever been
built and we all know where we've seen that

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.360
number before.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:24.060
Another conspiracy of modern times is that
Barack Obama is trying to bankrupt America.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:29.950
Conspiracy theorists believe that Obama is
a Muslim extremist that hates America and

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:33.030
wants to destroy it by any means possible.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:38.560
However it cannot be done by force so the
surely the fastest way to see America fall

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.579
would be to affect it financially.

00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:47.080
The US is currently in debt to the tune of
$17.2 trillion.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:53.140
During Obama's presidency campaign he promised
to cut America's deficit by half.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:03:00.470
But he in fact increased the nation's deficit
by a staggering $6.7 trillion.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:06.640
To put that in perspective during the 8 year
term of George W. Bush's presidency he increased

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:10.239
the deficit by $4.9 trillion.

00:03:10.239 --> 00:03:16.810
This of course has led to widespread conspiracies
suggesting that Obama secretly has malicious

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:20.260
intentions towards the US.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:26.769
If you've had the swine flu jab you may already
be a victim of a rather disturbing theory.

00:03:26.769 --> 00:03:32.829
Conspiracy theorists believe that the swine
flu and bird flu jabs and other vaccines contain

00:03:32.829 --> 00:03:36.879
microscopic computer chips invisible to the
naked eye.

00:03:36.879 --> 00:03:43.280
That have been injected into the population
en masse without them knowing.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:48.500
Theorists believe these nano chips will be
used to track and even control the entire

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.370
population.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:55.299
Some believe it has links to the New World
Order, and when the time comes for a mass

00:03:55.299 --> 00:04:01.840
population cull people who carry the nano
chip will be able to be terminated at the

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.420
flick of a switch.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:09.670
Theorists back up such theories with evidence
such as these thousands of plastic coffins

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:15.709
being stored in a field in Georgia, which
could be used to dispose of bodies in a mass

00:04:15.709 --> 00:04:16.880
cull.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:22.080
Although others say they are simply grave
liners, designed to protect real coffins from

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.570
the harsh elements.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:31.110
One of the most outlandish modern conspiracies
surrounds the Chelyabinsk Meteor that exploded

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:36.300
over Russia on the 15th February 2013.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:41.860
During midmorning a flash of light appeared
in the sky over the Russian town causing a

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:48.630
colossal shockwave that shook the surrounding
area, shattered hundreds of windows and injured

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:51.520
1,100 people.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:57.540
The most plausible explanation is that a meteor
entered the Earth's atmosphere and exploded

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:58.540
in the sky.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:04.530
But the creative minds of conspiracy theorists
all over the world came up with another scenario.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:13.250
That the the meteor was actually a manifestation
from the world's most advanced video game.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:20.010
The largest fragment found from the meteorite
could easily fit into a human hand.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:25.110
Conspiracy theorists maintain that such a
large object would not have been so thoroughly

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:28.050
vaporised as it seemed to have been.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:34.730
The absence of large fragments supports their
theory that an experimental video game developer

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:40.910
delving into the possibilities of virtual
reality, cracked the ultimate computer code

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:48.600
and allowed a video game experience to manifest
itself in reality.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:53.020
Could the United States be in cahoots with
North Korea?

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.520
That's what some theorists believe.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:02.430
The relationship between the United States
and North Korea is at all time low.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:09.740
But some people think it's all just a coverup
and the two countries are actually close allies

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.280
working together.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:17.540
There are only really three pieces of evidence
to back up these claims, firstly American

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:25.380
basketball player Dennis Rodman bizarrely
met with Kim Jong-un in North Korea and publicly

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:29.290
vowed eternal friendship with the North Korean
leader.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:35.310
The second piece of evidence is simply that
North Korea would have a pathetic chance if

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:42.690
it were to launch a war against the most technologically
advanced military in history, so becoming

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:47.270
enemies with them doesn't seem like a very
wise idea.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:55.830
And finally in 2012 the United States sent
a 240 thousand tonne shipment of food to North

00:06:55.830 --> 00:07:01.620
Korea, despite relations between the two countries
already being dire.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:22.560
Which begs the question why would they do
this if they're not allies?

